# PendingBot Admin (board console) — environment.
#
# In prod NOTHING here is needed: the SPA is bundled into the edge worker's
# static assets (served same-origin at bot.pendingname.com/board), so the edge
# base defaults to the page's own origin (see src/env.ts). Auth is Cloudflare
# Access (same-origin cookie) — no Supabase/Turnstile keys.
#
# Copy to `.env` ONLY for local dev, where the Vite dev server and the edge
# worker run on different origins and you must point the SPA at the edge.

# OPTIONAL override. Edge API base URL (no trailing slash); routes are <base>/v1/*.
# Absent → same-origin. Set it only for local dev (e.g. a prod or local edge).
VITE_EDGE_API_URL=https://bot.pendingname.com
